# why: Diagnostics for issue #39 (full screen goes back to the normal window by itself 1-9 s later; every time in
# Beanjar on webOS 4.4-10.3, not on a 43UR7500). Chrome itself sends set_state(0) with no event from LSM before it,
# and patch 0067 did not change that. Every layer that can start or report a full screen change now logs one
# "cn-fs:" line to browser.log (FullscreenController, BrowserView, DesktopWindowTreeHostPlatform, aura, the Wayland
# window and its state queue), so the first line before the exit shows who asked for it. The lines appear only on
# full screen changes and on state requests that differ from the applied state. To be removed once the cause is
# known.
